https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-04T18:59:09Z","updated_at":"2026-08-04T19:00:08Z","body":"Adding for 4.7 cherrypick, not good to have the most essential raytracing method broken in the major version where raytracing was introduced","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5183365135/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6093915019","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122051#issuecomment-6093915019","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122051","id":6093915019,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaznDiw","user":{"login":"PrimalBone","id":90038615,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMDM4NjE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90038615?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrimalBone","html_url":"https://github.com/PrimalBone","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrimalBone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrimalBone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrimalBone/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrimalBone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrimalBone/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrimalBone/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrimalBone/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrimalBone/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrimalBone/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-10T04:48:17Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T04:48:17Z","body":"Some measurements in case they help with the 4.7 cherry-pick. They come from a ray-traced GI add-on running on 4.7.2 (RTX 5080, NVIDIA driver 615.71.09, Linux). The comparisons use two local builds of 4.7.2-stable that differ only by this PR's commit. Both builds also carry a small patch of ours to the Forward+ renderer, which doesn't touch `RenderingDevice` or the Vulkan driver. The commit applies to 4.7.2-stable as is.\n\n**TLAS instance writes.** The \"potential CPU slowdown\" listed in the description is real on NVIDIA, and large. `RenderingDevice::tlas_build()` writes every instance it is given into the mapped instance buffer, so each rebuild pays the cost for every instance in the TLAS, not only for the instances that moved. The table shows our add-on's render-thread CPU time per frame (it includes the `tlas_build()` call), with 8000 MultiMesh instances moved every frame. Values are medians of 5 runs.\n\n| | 4.7.2 | 4.7.2 + this PR |\n|---|---|---|\n| Ray tracing pipeline | 2.35 ms | 0.63 ms |\n| Ray query | not available | 0.56 ms |\n\nThat is about 0.2 µs per instance per rebuild. The official 4.7.2 binary shows the same cost (2.56 ms).\n\n**Ray query.** 4.7.2 never requests `VK_KHR_ray_query` (#121286), so `rayQueryEXT` shaders can't run on hardware. With this PR, our test suite (100 scenes) passes on our ray-query path. It is also the fastest of our three tracing paths. Our demo scene at 1080p takes 1.82 ms of GPU frame time with ray query, against 2.07 ms with the ray tracing pipeline and 3.80 ms with our compute fallback.\n\nWe haven't seen any regression with this commit on 4.7.2.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6093915019/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6126957764","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122051#issuecomment-6126957764","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122051","id":6126957764,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABbTH0xA","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-12T15:05:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T15:05:56Z","body":"Cherry-picked for 4.7.3.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6126957764/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]